WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:04.400
Welcome to the TradeWave partner program.

2
00:00:04.800 --> 00:00:07.400
This short tour shows you everything you need.

3
00:00:07.900 --> 00:00:09.400
This is your home page.

4
00:00:09.750 --> 00:00:13.800
At the top you see what you've earned this month, what's waiting to be paid,

5
00:00:14.100 --> 00:00:15.600
and what you've been paid so far.

6
00:00:16.100 --> 00:00:21.000
If something needs your attention, like signing your agreement or adding a payout method,

7
00:00:21.300 --> 00:00:22.700
it shows up right here.

8
00:00:23.324 --> 00:00:24.324
Here's how you earn.

9
00:00:24.924 --> 00:00:28.024
You have a fifty percent share of the first-year price.

10
00:00:28.574 --> 00:00:31.724
You choose how much of it to give your audience as a discount,

11
00:00:31.924 --> 00:00:33.924
from zero to twenty-five percent,

12
00:00:34.274 --> 00:00:35.624
and you keep the rest.

13
00:00:36.274 --> 00:00:39.524
Twenty percent off for them means thirty percent for you.

14
00:00:40.074 --> 00:00:42.324
You can change it in Settings, once a day.

15
00:00:43.124 --> 00:00:47.174
After the first year, you earn twenty-five percent of every renewal.

16
00:00:47.835 --> 00:00:49.735
To share, open Links.

17
00:00:50.285 --> 00:00:53.735
Copy your link, or give people your code to type at checkout.

18
00:00:54.335 --> 00:00:59.135
You can make a tagged link for each place you post, like YouTube or your newsletter,

19
00:00:59.535 --> 00:01:01.535
and see which one brings in customers.

20
00:01:02.085 --> 00:01:06.635
On the Promote page you'll find banners, ready-made posts and a QR code,

21
00:01:06.635 --> 00:01:08.835
already filled in with your link.

22
00:01:09.237 --> 00:01:13.587
When TradeWave runs a sale, your customers get whichever price is lower,

23
00:01:13.937 --> 00:01:15.737
the sale or your discount,

24
00:01:15.987 --> 00:01:18.037
and the referral is always yours.

25
00:01:18.537 --> 00:01:19.637
One rule to remember:

26
00:01:20.137 --> 00:01:25.987
renewal commissions keep paying while you bring in at least one new paying customer every twelve months.

27
00:01:26.437 --> 00:01:30.387
Your dashboard always shows the date, and we email you well before it.

28
00:01:31.110 --> 00:01:33.310
To get paid, go to Payouts.

29
00:01:33.760 --> 00:01:37.360
Add your PayPal or Wise details and upload your tax form.

30
00:01:37.960 --> 00:01:42.110
Payouts go out by the fifteenth of each month, once you reach fifty dollars.

31
00:01:42.560 --> 00:01:44.260
Smaller amounts carry forward.

32
00:01:44.460 --> 00:01:45.710
They're never lost.

33
00:01:46.112 --> 00:01:46.962
Have a question?

34
00:01:47.412 --> 00:01:49.512
Click Help at the top of any page.

35
00:01:49.962 --> 00:01:52.312
It knows your agreement and your numbers.

36
00:01:52.662 --> 00:01:55.662
If it can't answer, it sends your question to our team,

37
00:01:56.062 --> 00:01:59.412
and the answer comes back right there, and in your Messages.

38
00:01:59.812 --> 00:02:00.362
That's it.

39
00:02:00.712 --> 00:02:01.712
Welcome aboard.

40
00:02:02.438 --> 00:02:05.038
Questions? Click Help in your dashboard.
